<node id="title" type="text" x="0" y="0" width="440" height="120" text-style="h1" text-align="left" vertical-align="top">

Turn SQL into a canvas that runs itself.

</node>

<node id="intro" type="text" x="0" y="140" width="400" height="100" text-align="left" vertical-align="top">

Every node is a DuckDB query, running here in your browser. Pick a station: the nodes reading it run again. Drag them around, or edit their SQL.

</node>

